  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The formula to calculate the radiation pressure is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>I</mi><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Also, the velocity of the electromagnetic wave can be expressed as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Equations (1) and (2) imply that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi>P</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>·</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mi>c</mi></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>"
